{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786659589561592001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"polite-antivirus-bedbug","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":3},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1783487109410485001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"75439901-da82-4761-a50a-ab2576879b91","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"b306-d68c-8ded-4bff"}],"description":"## Why\nCompaction now preserves folded event sources as `*.retired` (invariant I1, epic adept-hedge-stain / b306) instead of deleting them. Retention is currently **permanent** (accepted storage tradeoff); the tombstones accumulate on the tickets branch over time.\n\n## What\nAdd a branch-wide GC sweep that removes `*.retired` files provably past **causal stability** — no clone can still be mid-reconvergence against the pre-compaction events. Must honor the concurrency doctrine (I1-I9): never remove a `.retired` whose companion `.json` could still be reintroduced by an in-flight rebase/merge.\n\n## Scope\n- A `compact-gc` (or `compact --gc`) path listing `*.retired` under the tracker, removing only those past a configurable causal-stability horizon.\n- docs/concurrency.md I1: promote the 'follow-up' note to implemented behavior.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] GC removes only `*.retired` past the causal-stability horizon; recent ones kept.\n- [ ] Two-clone test: a not-yet-observed compaction's `.retired` files are NOT GC'd (no resurrection window).\n- [ ] fsck + replay remain clean after a GC sweep.\n- [ ] docs/concurrency.md I1 updated from 'follow-up' to 'implemented'.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"fbc4eea3-d810-4ecc-91f4-15f4fedf18fc","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"idea","tags":[],"ticket_id":"536b-8930-b922-4063","ticket_type":"task","title":"Branch-wide *.retired garbage-collection sweep (past causal stability)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["fe8298c8-7bfa-42a4-a0bf-466fcf7bae6c","fbc4eea3-d810-4ecc-91f4-15f4fedf18fc","75439901-da82-4761-a50a-ab2576879b91"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659589561592001,"uuid":"bcaf1338-b7d1-48c6-8652-140cdc165f81"}